### Phase 3 — Migrations (ordered by FK dependencies)

#### [NEW] create_districts_table migration
- `id`, `code` (string, unique, indexed), `name` (string), `geojson_key` (string, nullable), `timestamps`

#### [NEW] create_villages_table migration
- `id`, `district_id` FK → districts (constrained, cascadeOnDelete), `code` (string, unique, indexed), `name`, `timestamps`

#### [NEW] create_polling_stations_table migration
- `id`, `village_id` FK, `district_id` FK, `station_number` (integer, indexed), `venue_name` (varchar 200), `address` (text), `latitude` (decimal 10,8 nullable), `longitude` (decimal 11,8 nullable), `status` (string, default 'active', indexed), `notes` (text nullable), `softDeletes`, `timestamps`
- Composite index on `[district_id, status]`
- Unique constraint on `[village_id, station_number]`

#### [NEW] create_officers_table migration
- `id`, `name`, `phone` (indexed), `email` (nullable), `role` (string, indexed), `district_id` FK nullable, `status` (string, default 'active', indexed), `timestamps`

#### [NEW] create_assignments_table migration
- `id`, `polling_station_id` FK, `officer_id` FK, `role` (string), `confirmation_status` (string, default 'pending'), `notes` (text nullable), `assigned_at` (timestamp), `confirmed_at` (timestamp nullable), `timestamps`
- Unique constraint on `[polling_station_id, officer_id]`

#### [NEW] create_vote_results_table migration
- `id`, `polling_station_id` FK (unique), `party_votes` (integer), `total_votes` (integer), `dpt` (integer), `voters_present` (integer), `submitted_by` FK → users, `submitted_at` (timestamp), `verified` (boolean, default false), `timestamps`

---

### Phase 4 — Models (with relationships, scopes, casts)

#### [NEW] app/Models/District.php
- `$fillable`: code, name, geojson_key
- Relationships: `villages(): HasMany`, `pollingStations(): HasMany`
- Accessors: village_count, polling_station_count via `withCount`

#### [NEW] app/Models/Village.php
- `$fillable`: district_id, code, name
- Relationships: `district(): BelongsTo`, `pollingStations(): HasMany`

#### [NEW] app/Models/PollingStation.php
- `$fillable`: village_id, district_id, station_number, venue_name, address, latitude, longitude, status, notes
- `SoftDeletes` trait
- `casts()`: status → PollingStationStatus, latitude → decimal:8, longitude → decimal:8
- `$attributes`: status defaults to 'active'
- Relationships: `village(): BelongsTo`, `district(): BelongsTo`, `assignments(): HasMany`, `officers()` (through assignments), `voteResult(): HasOne`
- Scopes: `scopeActive()`, `scopeByDistrict($id)`, `scopeWithoutOfficer()`

#### [NEW] app/Models/Officer.php
- `$fillable`: name, phone, email, role, district_id, status
- `casts()`: role → OfficerRole, status → OfficerStatus
- `$attributes`: status defaults to 'active'
- Relationships: `district(): BelongsTo`, `assignments(): HasMany`

#### [NEW] app/Models/Assignment.php
- `$fillable`: polling_station_id, officer_id, role, confirmation_status, notes, assigned_at, confirmed_at
- `casts()`: role → OfficerRole, confirmation_status → ConfirmationStatus, assigned_at → datetime, confirmed_at → datetime
- `$attributes`: confirmation_status defaults to 'pending'
- Relationships: `pollingStation(): BelongsTo`, `officer(): BelongsTo`

#### [NEW] app/Models/VoteResult.php
- `$fillable`: polling_station_id, party_votes, total_votes, dpt, voters_present, submitted_by, submitted_at, verified
- `casts()`: verified → boolean, submitted_at → datetime
- Relationships: `pollingStation(): BelongsTo`, `submitter(): BelongsTo` (User)

