### Phase 6 — API Response Trait & Services

#### [NEW] app/Traits/ApiResponse.php
- `successResponse($data, $message, $statusCode, $meta)` → `{success: true, data, message, meta}`
- `errorResponse($message, $statusCode, $errors)` → `{success: false, message, errors}`

#### [NEW] app/Services/PollingStationService.php
- `getFilteredList($filters)`: handles district_id, village_id, status, search filters with pagination, eager loads district/village, uses `withCount('assignments')`
- `create($data)`: creates polling station
- `update(PollingStation, $data)`: updates
- `delete(PollingStation)`: soft deletes
- `getMapData($filters)`: returns GeoJSON-like collection
- `getExportData($filters)`: returns filtered query for Excel export

#### [NEW] app/Services/ImportService.php
- `importPollingStations(UploadedFile)`: delegates to PollingStationImport, returns summary
- Error handling and validation of uploaded file

#### [NEW] app/Services/DashboardService.php
- `getStats()`: total_tps, active_tps, covered_tps, total_officers, assignment_completion_rate, by_district breakdown
- Uses efficient aggregate queries with `withCount` and conditional counts

