### Phase 7 — Form Requests

#### [NEW] app/Http/Requests/StorePollingStationRequest.php
- Rules: village_id (required, exists), district_id (required, exists), station_number (required, integer), venue_name (required, max:200), address (required), latitude/longitude (nullable, numeric), status (nullable, in enum values), notes (nullable)
- Unique constraint: station_number per village

#### [NEW] app/Http/Requests/UpdatePollingStationRequest.php
- Same rules with `sometimes` modifier, unique constraint ignores current record

#### [NEW] app/Http/Requests/ImportPollingStationRequest.php
- Rules: file (required, mimes:xls,xlsx, max:10240)

