### Phase 9 — Controllers

#### [NEW] app/Http/Controllers/PollingStationController.php
- Constructor-injects `PollingStationService`
- `index()`: paginated, filtered list
- `store(StorePollingStationRequest)`: create via service
- `show(PollingStation)`: with officers/assignments eager loaded
- `update(UpdatePollingStationRequest, PollingStation)`: update via service
- `destroy(PollingStation)`: soft delete via service
- `import(ImportPollingStationRequest)`: delegates to ImportService
- `mapData(Request)`: GeoJSON-like response
- `export(Request)`: Excel download via Maatwebsite/Excel

#### [NEW] app/Http/Controllers/DistrictController.php
- `index()`: all districts with village_count, polling_station_count
- `show(District)`: with villages eager loaded

#### [NEW] app/Http/Controllers/VillageController.php
- `index(Request)`: filtered by district_id, with polling_station_count
- `show(Village)`: with polling_station_count

#### [NEW] app/Http/Controllers/OfficerController.php
- Full CRUD with filters (district_id, role, status)

#### [NEW] app/Http/Controllers/AssignmentController.php
- Full CRUD + `confirm(Assignment)` PATCH endpoint

#### [NEW] app/Http/Controllers/VoteResultController.php
