## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. `php artisan migrate:fresh` — verify all migrations run cleanly
2. `php artisan db:seed` — verify seeders work
3. `php artisan route:list --path=api` — verify all routes registered correctly
4. `vendor/bin/pint --dirty --format agent` — verify code style
5. Feature tests for critical endpoints (CRUD, import, dashboard)

### Manual Verification
- Test API endpoints via the running dev server
- Verify response format consistency across all endpoints
